WEBVTT

00:00:59.388 --> 00:01:00.556
Why?

00:01:00.598 --> 00:01:03.309
There are two misunderstandings
about meditation.

00:01:04.268 --> 00:01:09.107
So the first is many people think
meditation means, think of nothing,

00:01:09.148 --> 00:01:11.025
stop thinking,

00:01:11.025 --> 00:01:12.193
concentration.

00:01:12.693 --> 00:01:13.861
Ah.

00:01:13.861 --> 00:01:15.071
(Laughter)

00:01:15.113 --> 00:01:16.322
Shh!

00:01:16.322 --> 00:01:18.116
I'm meditating, keep quiet.

00:01:18.157 --> 00:01:19.617
(Laughter)

00:01:20.576 --> 00:01:24.038
So the more, when you try to stop thinking

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:25.832
what happens, you will think more.

00:01:25.832 --> 00:01:29.377
So we will do a small experiment, OK?

00:01:29.418 --> 00:01:32.797
Now, please don't think about pizza.